`--set` beats every config tier for this render only: the same template that shows the core default
in its sibling case shows the overridden value here.

-- fixtures/cwd/probe.md.j2 --
threshold {{ config.core.sprint.default_threshold_sp }}
-- cmd --
booping render /proc/self/cwd/probe.md.j2 --set core.sprint.default_threshold_sp=7
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
threshold 7
-- stderr --
